    {
      "type": "mechanism",
      "text": "5-HTP is the immediate precursor to serotonin (5-HT) and is converted via aromatic L-amino acid decarboxylase. Increased serotonin availability may improve mood, regulate appetite, and enhance sleep. Some serotonin is further metabolized to melatonin, supporting circadian rhythm."
    },
    {
